creatures:
- name: Dust Mephit
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 12  
      **Hit Points** 17 (rollable(dice=5d6,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 30 ft., Fly 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Initiative) (12)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=5)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-3,label=-3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=14)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+2,label=+2,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Vulnerabilities** fire  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** exhaustion, poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., Passive Perception 12  
      **Languages** Primordial (Auran, Terran)  
      **Challenge** 1/2 (100 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +2  

      ## Traits

      ***Death Burst.*** The mephit explodes when it dies. *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 10, each creature in a 5-foot ***Emanation*** originating from the mephit. *Failure:* rollable(dice=2d4,dicelabel=Damage [Death Burst]) Bludgeoning damage. *Success:* Half damage.

      ## Actions

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d4+2,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage.

      ***Blinding Breath (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 6,dicelabel=Recharge [Blinding Breath])).*** *Dexterity Saving Throw:* DC 10, each creature in a 15-foot ***Cone***. *Failure:* The target has the ***Blinded*** condition until the end of the mephit's next turn.

      ***Sleep (1/Day).*** The mephit casts the [Sleep](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619064-sleep) spell, requiring no spell components and using Charisma as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 10).

      1/day: [Sleep](https://www.dndbeyond.com/spells/2619064-sleep)  

    type: custom
  blurb: |
    # $[objectname]

    *Small Elemental, Neutral Evil*  
    **Challenge** 1/2
  subtype: npc
  id: srd2024dustmephit
  status: 1

